{
  "purpose": "Count how many monthly reports each partner program submitted in the previous calendar month so the program record shows recent reporting activity and compliance at-a-glance.",

"process": "This is a rollup on the Partner Programs table that aggregates linked Report records. The Reports table includes a formula field that flags records with a report_date in the previous month (e.g., returns 1 when DATETIME_DIFF or equivalent indicates last month). The progLastMonthReports rollup then SUMs that flag (or counts flagged items) and auto-updates whenever linked reports change. The resulting count is used in the monthly compliance/eligibility workflow—feeding dashboards, triggering follow-up tasks or alerts, and contributing to eligibility or funding decisions for partner programs."
}

