fldBOyL8MasFwPBV7:
/************************************************************
ARCHR Eligibility Report Email Renderer — Airtable-safe version

Uses individual triage fields:
- triageScore
- triageMessage
- triageDemo
- triageCategoriesRaw
- triageWait

Also supports:
- claimsRaw: "(5/13/2026) | 🪝Claimed | AAHH"

Inputs:
- subjectTemplate
- headTemplate
- bodyTemplate
- reportItemsJSON
- reportName
- reportOrg
- reportStart
- reportEnd

Outputs:
- subject
- html
- text
- reportCount
************************************************************/

const config = input.config();

/************************************************************
INPUT HELPERS
************************************************************/

