{
  "purpose": "Provides a single, per-organization summary of reports submitted in the previous week so downstream users and automations can see recent reporting activity at a glance.",

"process": "Automatically populated by an Airtable rollup on the Organizations Sync record that aggregates values from linked report records (e.g., count or list of report IDs/statuses). The rollup uses a helper formula or date-based flag on the source report records to include only items dated within the last 7 days, and applies an aggregation function (COUNT, SUM or ARRAYJOIN) to produce the final value. This field is used in the weekly organization sync / monitoring workflow for eligibility and compliance: driving dashboards, flags for follow-up, and inputs to ARCHR eligibility decisions and automations."
}

